  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.14.0 adds lifecycle-safe terminal color ownership: query-before-mutate palette and dynamic-color leases; exact observed 16-bit baseline replay; identity-aware nested and out-of-order ownership; invalidation recovery; suspend baseline restoration and post-resume re-observation before retained-state reapply; restoration retry semantics; session-disposal cleanup; concurrency/failure hardening; and downstream Icod.DCurses scoped-color acceptance. OSC 104 and OSC 110-119 remain terminal-policy resets and are never substituted for exact lease restoration.",
